{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","id":"3052d18b-0430-416d-9a5c-cc1da92310e6","timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:15:15.147Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"485c188f91e05dadbab622e1b795930da18435c50711d2ca757d61c310dfb334","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"692c4365-65b6-4f3c-b351-8ffe248991fb","keep":372,"tail":["ab46c79ee15bf7ab8680e497d221a8b300f8664bfafa553d3e9f4a5f8c190836","c165bc0aea7e3cd8b4681ba1edae58de8c1920759c0c58f293a905d2fc529580"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",373,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"095387a5c7586171bca439e73d0156c8581ee3f190be255c48b9faa5b49fa483"}
{"parentUuid":"ade5ea0f-0a4b-4c49-b543-b170781fb631","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeAQjSZjBmmFECqTYfcx","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've made all of your command-page changes. They're live at http://localhost:4329/docs/commands and not committed.\n\n**Command pages**\n- **More room:** the content column is now wider, and the right pane is narrower and further right, since its list is short. At a 1440px window the syntax lines now almost fit without scrolling.\n- **Syntax block:** it keeps the line breaks the help file has, one group of parameters per line, instead of breaking inside a parameter like `[-` / `Product`. If it runs past 5 lines it shows the first 5 with a fade and a **Show full syntax** button, so the description below is in view.\n- **Long names:** titles use a smaller font. Names over 26 characters get smaller still, so `Get-MtUserAuthenticationMethodInfoByType` fits on one line and no longer runs under the Copy page button.\n\n**Left nav**\n- **By job (the default):** it starts with **Start here**, showing **Connect-Maester** and **Invoke-Maester** in bold with a red dot. Then come the groups, taken from the module's own folders:\n  - Connect\n  - Run and write tests\n  - Reports and alerts\n  - Maester Packs\n  - Automation setup\n  - Entra and Microsoft Graph\n  - Exchange and email\n  - Azure and SharePoint\n  - Active Directory\n\n  The four service groups start collapsed and open when you're on one of their pages.\n- **A to Z:** a switch at the top lists every command alphabetically. Your choice is remembered.\n- **One line per name:** long names end in an ellipsis, and the full name shows on hover.\n\n**Commands overview**\n- **Two key commands up top:** large cards, \"Step 1 · Sign in\" for Connect-Maester and \"Step 2 · Run the checks\" for Invoke-Maester.\n- **Groups:** a row of group chips with counts, then each group with a line on what it's for and a card per command. \"On this page\" now lists the groups.\n- **Keeping it in sync:** the groups come from the folder each command lives in. A new command lands in the right group by itself, and one in a new folder shows under \"Other\" until it's added to [command-groups.mjs](.claude/worktrees/website-astro/website/src/lib/command-groups.mjs).\n\nOne thing I noticed: in Invoke-Maester's description, `Test.*.ps1` and `*.Tests.ps1` turn part of a sentence into italics. The `*` characters come from the comment-based help in the module source. That page is generated, so the fix belongs in the source and not in the website files."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_read_input_tokens":351977,"output_tokens":834,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":834,"cache_read_input_tokens":351977,"cache_creation_input_tokens":306,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":306},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"b95a7c27-68ef-47a5-9ade-dc127626bd85","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeAQj4FggL6krCNpWkjP","requestRef":"3052d18b-0430-416d-9a5c-cc1da92310e6","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"541ddd81-9f52-4d6a-99dd-8130168f0049","timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:15:23.685Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a",