{"parentUuid":"f19be1bb-88cf-4693-af54-4fa1d5c16098","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"965940d5-f797-4efc-9677-e515317c5404","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EzLSDDoP21v1JuR2ZfYU6z","type":"tool_result","content":"e Directory tests, preview tests and long-running tests. With -Path, native custom tests (`Test.*.ps1`) are found anywhere under the path and Pester-format custom tests (`*.Tests.ps\n M website/docs/commands/Add-MtMaesterAppFederatedCredential.mdx\n M website/docs/commands/Add-MtReportAttachment.mdx\n M website/docs/commands/Add-MtTestResultDetail.mdx","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d0d2ef49-8212-4610-a135-950a7d6487ed","timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:24:26.904Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"e Directory tests, preview tests and long-running tests. With -Path, native custom tests (`Test.*.ps1`) are found anywhere under the path and Pester-format custom tests (`*.Tests.ps\n M website/docs/commands/Add-MtMaesterAppFederatedCredential.mdx\n M website/docs/commands/Add-MtReportAttachment.mdx\n M website/docs/commands/Add-MtTestResultDetail.mdx","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro/powershell/public/run/Invoke-Maester.ps1","hunks":[{"oldStart":8,"oldLines":7,"newStart":8,"newLines":7,"lines":[" ","     For more advanced configuration, you can directly use the Pester module and the Get-MtHtmlReport function."," ","-    By default, Invoke-Maester runs the tests that ship with Maester and the custom tests in the Custom folder of the current directory, except Active Directory tests, preview tests and long-running tests. With -Path, native custom tests (Test.*.ps1) are found anywhere under the path and Pester-format custom tests (*.Tests.ps1) only in a Custom folder. Folders are searched up to three levels deep. Active Directory tests run only after an explicit Connect-Maester -Service ActiveDirectory call succeeds.","+    By default, Invoke-Maester runs the tests that ship with Maester and the custom tests in the Custom folder of the current directory, except Active Directory tests, preview tests and long-running tests. With -Path, native custom tests (`Test.*.ps1`) are found anywhere under the path and Pester-format custom tests (`*.Tests.ps1`) only in a Custom folder. Folders are searched up to three levels deep. Active Directory tests run only after an explicit Connect-Maester -Service ActiveDirectory call succeeds."," ","     -Product, -Feature, -Area, -Severity and -Suite select tests by their typed attributes. Each takes a list: the values of one selector are alternatives, and different selectors must all match. They combine the same way with -Tag and -TestId. -ExcludeProduct leaves out the tests of a product and wins over every selector. The tags of Maester 2.x, such as CA or CIS, still select the same built-in tests."," "]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro/powershell/public/run/Invoke-Maester.ps1"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"542ac977-acda-446e-9782-ed3244d26117","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","root":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","branch":"feat/website-astro","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":2378,"modified":316,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":62},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"maester365/maester","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"blindzero","host":"github.com","remote":"blindzero/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"jeanphilippegeorge","host":"github.com","remote":"JeanPhilippeGeorge/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"mynster","host":"github.com","remote":"Mynster9361/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"maester36