{"parentUuid":"0a9c410d-18ff-466c-84f5-7357349adbfc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeChkM6vR8a3tX93eWSZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1530,"cache_read_input_tokens":375214,"output_tokens":1509,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":137},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1530,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1509,"cache_read_input_tokens":375214,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1530},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":1374,"thinkingDisplay":"updates","serverClassifierRequest":"df425167-3775-4e75-bd20-4fe7591b2427","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeChjyGmmLAgKybi5jJU","requestRef":"8c7865c6-84d2-49d4-b2f0-9704f57bb935","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3da3662c-e426-4403-bfb2-000c6bd8fe82","timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:45:21.845Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"feat/website-astro","slug":"breezy-giggling-flame"}
{"parentUuid":"3da3662c-e426-4403-bfb2-000c6bd8fe82","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeChkM6vR8a3tX93eWSZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014azvRpWBpBPBXwiGfVCKtD","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md","content":"## 📑 Description\n\nRebuilds maester.dev on **Astro 7 + Starlight**, replacing Docusaurus. Every URL the old site had still resolves: `src/data/url-contract.txt` (2,679 URLs) is checked on every build, and `dist/_redirects` is generated for Cloudflare Pages.\n\n**Docs**\n- Docs default to the 3.0 preview. Pages mark what differs from the stable release, and the 2.x guides are kept as an archive at `/docs/2.x`. The 2.x command and test pages are dropped; their URLs redirect to the current pages.\n- `:::note` / `:::caution` callouts now render. The content lives outside `src/content/docs`, so Starlight needs the folders named in `markdown.processedDirs`.\n\n**Test catalog** (`/docs/tests`)\n- Generated from `src/data/test-catalog.json`.\n- Filters: a searchable product → feature tree, area, suite and severity toggles. A copyable `Invoke-Maester` command matches the filters.\n\n**Commands** (`/docs/commands`)\n- Grouped by job, from the module's folders (connect, run, report, packs, app, services/*), with an A to Z switch in the sidebar.\n- Connect-Maester and Invoke-Maester come first. Long syntax blocks collapse behind \"Show full syntax\", and pages are wider.\n\n**Blog**\n- Its own content collection on the site layout, with no docs sidebar.\n- Card index, reading-width posts, topic and author pages, and RSS at `/blog/rss.xml`. `starlight-blog` is removed.\n\n**Home page**\n- The real 3.0 HTML report as a live demo, with auto-rotating views.\n- A click-to-play HyperFrames explainer with a Kokoro voice-over and synthesised music. The audio tools in `website/scripts/narration` are not part of the build.\n\n**Test builder** has its own header tab, inside the docs layout.\n\n**Module help**\n- `Invoke-Maester`: backticks around `Test.*.ps1` / `*.Tests.ps1`, which rendered as italics.\n- `Invoke-MtGraphRequest`: `:::note` instead of the unsupported `:::info`.\n- Command pages regenerated with `./build/Update-CommandReference.ps1`.\n\n## ✅ Checks\n\n- [x] My pull request adheres to the code style of this project.\n- [x] My code requires changes to the documentation.\n- [x] I have updated the documentation as required.\n- [ ] The build and unit tests pass after running `/powershell/tests/pester.ps1` locally. 6,566 of 6,567 pass. The one failure is local: `ZeroTrustAssessmentPack.Tests.ps1` expects the ZeroTrustAssessment module not to be installed, and it is on the machine that ran them. This PR changes only two lines of help text in the module.\n\n## ℹ️ Additional Information\n\nBefore merging:\n- **Cloudflare Pages settings must change:** build output `website/dist`, Node 24. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed; `build-website.yaml` builds the new site.\n- **Customer story:** the Xbox story stays hidden until `src/data/media.json` has an approved date. The quotes need sign-off from Audrey Long and Microsoft.\n- **Report icons:** `website/public/report-icons/v1` is copied from the report redesign work, which keeps them in `website/static/report-icons/`. Reconcile the two locations when that work lands.\n\nLocal check: `cd website && npm ci && npm run build && npm run preview`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1530,"cache_read_input_tokens":375214,"output_tokens":1509,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":137},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1530,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1509,"cache_read_input_tokens":375214,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1530},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_014azvRpWBpBPBXwiGfVCKtD":{"file_path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md","content":"## 📑 Description\n\nRebuilds maester.dev on **Astro 7 + Starlight**, replacing Docusaurus. Every URL the old site had still resolves: `src/data/url-contract.txt` (2,679 URLs) is checked on every build, and `dist/_redirects` is generated for Cloudflare Pages.\n\n**Docs**\n- Docs default to the 3.0 preview. Pages mark what differs from the stable release, and the 2.x guides are kept as an archive at `/docs/2.x`. The 2.x command and test pages are dropped; their URLs redirect to the current pages.\n- `:::note` / `:::caution` callouts now render. The content lives outside `src/content/docs`, so Starlight needs the folders named in `markdown.processedDirs`.\n\n**Test catalog** (`/docs/tests`)\n- Generated from `src/data/test-catalog.json`.\n- Filters: a searchable product → feature tree, area, suite and severity toggles. A copyable `Invoke-Maester` command matches the filters.\n\n**Commands** (`/docs/commands`)\n- Grouped by job, from the module's folders (connect, run, report, packs, app, services/*), with an A to Z switch in the sidebar.\n- Connect-Maester and Invoke-Maester come first. Long syntax blocks collapse behind \"Show full syntax\", and pages are wider.\n\n**Blog**\n- Its own content collection on the site layout, with no docs sidebar.\n- Card index, reading-width posts, topic and author pages, and RSS at `/blog/rss.xml`. `starlight-blog` is removed.\n\n**Home page**\n- The real 3.0 HTML report as a live demo, with auto-rotating views.\n- A click-to-play HyperFrames explainer with a Kokoro voice-over and synthesised music. The audio tools in `website/scripts/narration` are not part of the build.\n\n**Test builder** has its own header tab, inside the docs layout.\n\n**Module help**\n- `Invoke-Maester`: backticks around `Test.*.ps1` / `*.Tests.ps1`, which rendered as italics.\n- `Invoke-MtGraphRequest`: `:::note` instead of the unsupported `:::info`.\n- Command pages regenerated with `./build/Update-CommandReference.ps1`.\n\n## ✅ Checks\n\n- [x] My pull request adheres to the code style of this project.\n- [x] My code requires changes to the documentation.\n- [x] I have updated the documentation as required.\n- [ ] The build and unit tests pass after running `/powershell/tests/pester.ps1` locally. 6,566 of 6,567 pass. The one failure is local: `ZeroTrustAssessmentPack.Tests.ps1` expects the ZeroTrustAssessment module not to be installed, and it is on the machine that ran them. This PR changes only two lines of help text in the module.\n\n## ℹ️ Additional Information\n\nBefore merging:\n- **Cloudflare Pages settings must change:** build output `website/dist`, Node 24. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed; `build-website.yaml` builds the new site.\n- **Customer story:** the Xbox story stays hidden until `src/data/media.json` has an approved date. The quotes need sign-off from Audrey Long and Microsoft.\n- **Report icons:** `website/public/report-icons/v1` is copied from the report redesign work, which keeps them in `website/static/report-icons/`. Reconcile the two locations when that work lands.\n\nLocal check: `cd website && npm ci && npm run build && npm run preview`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"df425167-3775-4e75-bd20-4fe7591b2427","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgeChjyGmmLAgKybi5jJU","requestRef":"8c7865c6-84d2-49d4-b2f0-9704f57bb935","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fe9bd657-bb69-40ec-9f2f-79d85887b701","timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:45:32.827Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"feat/website-astro","slug":"breezy-giggling-flame"}
{"parentUuid":"fe9bd657-bb69-40ec-9f2f-79d85887b701","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"5174c724-0ae6-4de8-9245-d135ac2b4af9","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014azvRpWBpBPBXwiGfVCKtD","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"7c231734-3ffe-400c-afae-dffaf05e293f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T13:45:32.838Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md","content":"## 📑 Description\n\nRebuilds maester.dev on **Astro 7 + Starlight**, replacing Docusaurus. Every URL the old site had still resolves: `src/data/url-contract.txt` (2,679 URLs) is checked on every build, and `dist/_redirects` is generated for Cloudflare Pages.\n\n**Docs**\n- Docs default to the 3.0 preview. Pages mark what differs from the stable release, and the 2.x guides are kept as an archive at `/docs/2.x`. The 2.x command and test pages are dropped; their URLs redirect to the current pages.\n- `:::note` / `:::caution` callouts now render. The content lives outside `src/content/docs`, so Starlight needs the folders named in `markdown.processedDirs`.\n\n**Test catalog** (`/docs/tests`)\n- Generated from `src/data/test-catalog.json`.\n- Filters: a searchable product → feature tree, area, suite and severity toggles. A copyable `Invoke-Maester` command matches the filters.\n\n**Commands** (`/docs/commands`)\n- Grouped by job, from the module's folders (connect, run, report, packs, app, services/*), with an A to Z switch in the sidebar.\n- Connect-Maester and Invoke-Maester come first. Long syntax blocks collapse behind \"Show full syntax\", and pages are wider.\n\n**Blog**\n- Its own content collection on the site layout, with no docs sidebar.\n- Card index, reading-width posts, topic and author pages, and RSS at `/blog/rss.xml`. `starlight-blog` is removed.\n\n**Home page**\n- The real 3.0 HTML report as a live demo, with auto-rotating views.\n- A click-to-play HyperFrames explainer with a Kokoro voice-over and synthesised music. The audio tools in `website/scripts/narration` are not part of the build.\n\n**Test builder** has its own header tab, inside the docs layout.\n\n**Module help**\n- `Invoke-Maester`: backticks around `Test.*.ps1` / `*.Tests.ps1`, which rendered as italics.\n- `Invoke-MtGraphRequest`: `:::note` instead of the unsupported `:::info`.\n- Command pages regenerated with `./build/Update-CommandReference.ps1`.\n\n## ✅ Checks\n\n- [x] My pull request adheres to the code style of this project.\n- [x] My code requires changes to the documentation.\n- [x] I have updated the documentation as required.\n- [ ] The build and unit tests pass after running `/powershell/tests/pester.ps1` locally. 6,566 of 6,567 pass. The one failure is local: `ZeroTrustAssessmentPack.Tests.ps1` expects the ZeroTrustAssessment module not to be installed, and it is on the machine that ran them. This PR changes only two lines of help text in the module.\n\n## ℹ️ Additional Information\n\nBefore merging:\n- **Cloudflare Pages settings must change:** build output `website/dist`, Node 24. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed; `build-website.yaml` builds the new site.\n- **Customer story:** the Xbox story stays hidden until `src/data/media.json` has an approved date. The quotes need sign-off from Audrey Long and Microsoft.\n- **Report icons:** `website/public/report-icons/v1` is copied from the report redesign work, which keeps them in `website/static/report-icons/`. Reconcile the two locations when that work lands.\n\nLocal check: `cd website && npm ci && npm run build && npm run preview`.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fe9bd657-bb69-40ec-9f2f-79d85887b701","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"feat/website-astro","slug":"breezy-giggling-flame"}
