{"parentUuid":"124f44ee-f546-4b40-b11e-755481129c01","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeCjx4rm5GKEUJ2gfcVu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I opened the pull request for the website rebuild as ready for review, against `main`:\n\n<pr-created>https://github.com/maester365/maester/pull/2647</pr-created>\n\nI used `feat/website-astro`, not `feat/console-status-pill`, which the request named. That branch is the main checkout's, and it already has a merged PR (#2593), so it isn't this work.\n\nThe description follows the repo's PR template. Its \"Before merging\" list tells reviewers three things:\n\n- **Cloudflare Pages settings need changing:** build output becomes `website/dist`, on Node 24.\n- **Customer story:** the Xbox story stays hidden until Audrey Long and Microsoft sign off on the quotes.\n- **Report icons:** the copy in `public/report-icons` needs reconciling with the report redesign branch, which keeps them in `static/report-icons`.\n\nOn tests, the description says 6,566 of 6,567 passed. The one failure only happens on your machine because the ZeroTrustAssessment module is installed here.\n\nCI hasn't reported on the PR yet."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":308,"cache_read_input_tokens":379664,"output_tokens":351,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":308,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":351,"cache_read_input_tokens":379664,"cache_creation_input_tokens":308,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":308},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management"