{"parentUuid":"47fff110-26ba-4454-a8e8-cc72d72efba8","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeCtx1sX4uEFKZa679iZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I merged `main` into PR #2647 to clear the merge conflict and pushed it as `1ddc0e4b5`.\n\n- **The conflict:** only `website/package-lock.json` conflicted. `main` had a Dependabot bump of `follow-redirects` to 1.16.2, but in the old Docusaurus lockfile. The new site doesn't use that package, so I kept this branch's lockfile. The security fix isn't lost, because the dependency no longer exists here.\n- **Other changes from main:** an update to `sponsors.json` merged without conflict.\n- **Checked:** dependencies resolve, the site builds, and all 2,679 old URLs still resolve.\n- **Push:** the first push was rejected by GitHub with a generic \"failed\" message, and the retry went through.\n- **The review comment:** CodeRabbit's automatic walkthrough, which said its details were left out to fit the comment limit. There was nothing to act on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":274,"cache_read_input_tokens":387071,"output_tokens":310,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":274,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":310,"cache_read_input_tokens":387071,"cache_creation_input_tokens":274,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":274},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"a5113fe4-afcf-4e20-868a-0db5aa0b0746","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeCtwiXK7yT2oFB6cnxA","requestRef":"da2a33ed-c2f1-4