{"parentUuid":"23aec050-427f-4bdf-9ab1-249769a0e756","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeD2NiNP4d7U5FykXDL9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the failing `dependency-review` check on PR #2647 and pushed it as `815af1871`. CI hasn't run on the new commit yet, so the check isn't green yet.\n\n- **Cause:** the explainer narration tool (`website/scripts/narration`) uses `kokoro-js`, which pulls in `sharp` 0.34.5. That version has three high-severity advisories, in the image libraries it bundles. The site's own dependencies passed the check.\n- **Fix:** I pinned `sharp` to 0.35.5 in the narration tool's `package.json`, the same version the site already uses. A short test clip from the tool still generated correctly.\n- **Codacy comment:** it reports 0 new issues, so there was nothing to fix."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_read_input_tokens":398152,"output_tokens":248,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":197,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":248,"cache_read_input_tokens":398152,"cache_creation_input_tokens":197,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":197},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"2528943e-fa05-4173-85eb-4236fef23848","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeD2N6fEBE5MD8SNdTxo","requestRef":"b67da5e3-5fd6-43e6-b092-3d3b9b9ed0ee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"c684c8bd-64dd-43e8-b302-785228f66f6b