{"parentUuid":"1d6da55a-2cd0-4730-938a-bcff25def6a0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeDFNDxzbx5oJ17vygxC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I fixed the CodeQL alert on PR #2647, pushed the fix as `8247f17b7`, and replied in the review thread and resolved it. CI still has to run on the new commit.\n\n- **The problem:** `website/src/lib/summary.mjs` turns Markdown into the plain text used for page descriptions, and it removed HTML comments in a single pass. A crafted string like `<!<!---->--` would come out as a new `<!--`, which is what CodeQL flagged.\n- **The fix:** it now removes comments over and over until nothing changes. Then it drops any `<!--`, `-->`, `{/*` or `*/}` left without its partner.\n- **Checked:** the crafted string now comes out clean, normal summaries are unchanged, the site builds, and all old URLs still resolve."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_read_input_tokens":404285,"output_tokens":264,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":264,"cache_read_input_tokens":404285,"cache_creation_input_tokens":204,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":204},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"8cbc12bb-ab3e-49e0-91d7-ea6c05816731","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgeDFMssy9z4SoBj4wiUT","requestRef":"f2095165-6a09-4116-840a-7ee6cdb06d5c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","u