tionalAccessWhatIf | Maester Reference](https://maester\nwebsite/docs/connect-maester/connect-maester-advanced.mdx:34:The Maester module includes [`Connect-Maester`](/docs/commands/Connect-Maester) to provide coverage for common scenarios. The parameter set options afford a us\nwebsite/contributors/contributors.yml:28:# email-aliases.json — a machine-maintained file, don't edit it), and your\nwebsite/sponsors/featured.yml:4:# Kept by hand. website/scripts/sponsors.mjs copies this list into website/src/data/sponsors.json, which the\nwebsite/sponsors/featured.yml:6:# needed: `cd website && node scripts/sponsors.mjs`) or let the update-sponsors workflow do it.\nwebsite/contributors/README.md:21:   [`email-aliases.json`](./email-aliases.json) (machine-maintained — never\nwebsite/contributors/README.md:23:4. The result is snapshotted to `website/src/data/contributors.json` (used when CI\nwebsite/scripts/contributors.mjs:8:// website/src/data/contributors.json; when full git history is unavailable the\nwebsite/scripts/contributors.mjs:22:const emailAliasesPath = join(websiteRoot, \"contributors\", \"email-aliases.json\");\nwebsite/scripts/contributors.mjs:23:const snapshotPath = join(websiteRoot, \"src\", \"data\", \"contributors.json\");\nwebsite/scripts/contributors.mjs:194:        \"Full git history is unavailable (shallow clone) and no contributors snapshot exists at website/src/data/contributors.json.\"\nwebsite/scripts/contributors.mjs:248:    log(\"Updated contributors/email-aliases.json with newly resolved contributors.\");\nwebsite/scripts/export-catalog.mjs:1:// Refreshes src/data/test-catalog.json from the test source with Get-MtTest (build/docs/Export-MtTestCatalogForDocs.ps1).\nwebsite/scripts/export-catalog.mjs:3:// build) uses the committed catalog, which the update-test-docs workflow refreshes after each merge.\nwebsite/scripts/export-catalog.mjs:8:const output = fileURLToPath(new URL('../src/data/test-catalog.json', import.meta.url));\nwebsite/scripts/upd