contributor data of the website (website/src/data/contributors.json, which the website's own\nbuild/Update-ConsoleContributors.ps1:28:    [string] $Source = \"$PSScriptRoot/../website/src/data/contributors.json\",\nbuild/Update-CommandReference.ps1:1:# Description: This script is used to generate the 'Command Reference' section of the Maester website (website/docs/commands)\nbuild/Update-CommandReference.ps1:19:$commandsIndexFile = \"./website/docs/commands/readme.mdx\"\nbuild/Update-CommandReference.ps1:54:$multiFunctionCandidates = Get-ChildItem ./website/docs/commands -Filter *.mdx | Where-Object { -not $editUrlByCommand.ContainsKey($_.BaseName) }\nbuild/Update-CommandReference.ps1:66:$cmdMarkdownFiles = Get-ChildItem ./website/docs/commands -Filter *.mdx | Where-Object { $_.Name -ne 'readme.mdx' }\nbuild/Update-CommandReference.ps1:114:Remove-Item ./website/docs/commands/docusaurus.sidebar.js -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue\nbuild/Build-MaesterModule.ps1:783:$ContributorData = Join-Path $RepoRoot 'website/src/data/contributors.json'\nbuild/docs/Export-MtTestCatalogForDocs.ps1:27:    Where to write the JSON file. Defaults to website/src/data/test-catalog.json, the catalog the website builds from.\nbuild/docs/Export-MtTestCatalogForDocs.ps1:32:    Writes website/src/data/test-catalog.json. The website's build turns it into the test pages; `npm run\nbuild/docs/Export-MtTestCatalogForDocs.ps1:43:if (-not $OutputPath) { $OutputPath = Join-Path -Path $repoRoot -ChildPath 'website' -AdditionalChildPath 'src', 'data', 'test-catalog.json' }","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a2b9df8c-77f5-49a9-9ab9-259a289a1a7b","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","root":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","branch":"feat/website-astro","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,