{"parentUuid":"535bb45b-21d7-460b-b5ba-5aaefc9a4133","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgehPrtcpvivYkAjewUzg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QneFASUKx4Wb9FB6FDpZHu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"P=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md && python3 - \"$P\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\na='''**Test builder** has its own header tab, inside the docs layout.\n'''\nb=a+'''\n**Build and deploy**\n- `build-website.yaml` builds the site on pull requests and, on every push to main, daily and on request, deploys it to Cloudflare Pages with `wrangler pages deploy`.\n- The generated data is no longer committed: the test catalog, command pages, contributor credits and sponsors are written by `website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs` before each `npm run dev` / `npm run build`.\n- `update-sponsors`, `update-module-docs` and `update-test-docs` are removed, so merges no longer produce bot PRs to approve.\n- The README's sponsor avatars are an image built on each deploy (`maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg`).\n'''\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\na='''- **Cloudflare Pages settings must change:** build output `website/dist`, Node 24. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed; `build-website.yaml` builds the new site.'''\nb='''- **Cloudflare deploys from Actions:** create a `maester.dev` environment with the secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` (Cloudflare Pages: Edit) and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`. Set the `CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT` variable if the Pages project isn't named `maester`, and turn off the project's own builds from git. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed.'''\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngh pr edit 2647 --body-file \"$P\" >/dev/null && echo edited","description":"Update the PR description for the new deploy"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1773,"cache_read_input_tokens":208781,"output_tokens":1439,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":54},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1773,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1439,"cache_read_input_tokens":208781,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1773},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01QneFASUKx4Wb9FB6FDpZHu":{"command":"cd /Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro && P=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md && python3 - \"$P\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\na='''**Test builder** has its own header tab, inside the docs layout.\n'''\nb=a+'''\n**Build and deploy**\n- `build-website.yaml` builds the site on pull requests and, on every push to main, daily and on request, deploys it to Cloudflare Pages with `wrangler pages deploy`.\n- The generated data is no longer committed: the test catalog, command pages, contributor credits and sponsors are written by `website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs` before each `npm run dev` / `npm run build`.\n- `update-sponsors`, `update-module-docs` and `update-test-docs` are removed, so merges no longer produce bot PRs to approve.\n- The README's sponsor avatars are an image built on each deploy (`maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg`).\n'''\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\na='''- **Cloudflare Pages settings must change:** build output `website/dist`, Node 24. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed; `build-website.yaml` builds the new site.'''\nb='''- **Cloudflare deploys from Actions:** create a `maester.dev` environment with the secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` (Cloudflare Pages: Edit) and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`. Set the `CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT` variable if the Pages project isn't named `maester`, and turn off the project's own builds from git. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed.'''\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngh pr edit 2647 --body-file \"$P\" >/dev/null && echo edited","description":"Update the PR description for the new deploy"}},"wireIngestContext":{"toolu_01QneFASUKx4Wb9FB6FDpZHu":{"cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"210a4485-ad35-4270-b392-e55d5387717e","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgehPrcznZNgKxq9LeRiL","requestRef":"2e9afc37-9053-4c8c-9936-180dfd09d998","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"update_plan","type":"assistant","uuid":"369ac427-a883-4101-990c-1ab5f527df6e","timestamp":"2026-11-02T20:01:42.961Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"feat/website-astro","slug":"breezy-giggling-flame"}
{"parentUuid":"369ac427-a883-4101-990c-1ab5f527df6e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgehPrtcpvivYkAjewUzg","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BGyQ2gmgb8KgoM8AtnEwj8","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/merill/.claude/projects/-Users-merill-github-maester/memory/maester-dev-site-redesign.md","old_string":"**Why:** Merill wants","new_string":"Round 4 (2026-11-03, Merill's ruling \"Yes, do it here\"): no bot PRs for site data. build-website.yaml builds on PRs and deploys to Cloudflare Pages via wrangler on push to main + daily + dispatch (env `maester.dev`, secrets CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN/ACCOUNT_ID, var CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT default `maester`; Merill must set these and disable Cloudflare git builds). test-catalog.json, contributors.json, sponsors.json, docs/commands/*.mdx (not readme.mdx) are gitignored and written by website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs (predev/prebuild; `npm run refresh-data`). update-sponsors/update-module-docs/update-test-docs workflows deleted. README sponsors = featured logos + maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg wall; `sponsors.mjs --readme`, PR check. Commit 7bc62f290 on PR 2647. The publish-module release-version PR still needs manual merge (ruleset requires 1 approval).\n\n**Why:** Merill wants"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1773,"cache_read_input_tokens":208781,"output_tokens":1439,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":54},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1773,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1439,"cache_read_input_tokens":208781,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1773,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h