"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"feat/website-astro","slug":"breezy-giggling-flame"}
{"parentUuid":"c81e4600-a064-41b7-970b-55d7e29f950a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"85e869c8-29fb-4e15-90c4-611f26363c9b","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BGyQ2gmgb8KgoM8AtnEwj8","type":"tool_result","content":"The file /Users/merill/.claude/projects/-Users-merill-github-maester/memory/maester-dev-site-redesign.md has been updated successfully."}]},"uuid":"0d71e95b-dfeb-4cd0-945a-dea2c53001ed","timestamp":"2026-11-02T20:01:50.637Z","toolUseResult":{"filePath":"/Users/merill/.claude/projects/-Users-merill-github-maester/memory/maester-dev-site-redesign.md","oldString":"**Why:** Merill wants","newString":"Round 4 (2026-11-03, Merill's ruling \"Yes, do it here\"): no bot PRs for site data. build-website.yaml builds on PRs and deploys to Cloudflare Pages via wrangler on push to main + daily + dispatch (env `maester.dev`, secrets CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN/ACCOUNT_ID, var CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT default `maester`; Merill must set these and disable Cloudflare git builds). test-catalog.json, contributors.json, sponsors.json, docs/commands/*.mdx (not readme.mdx) are gitignored and written by website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs (predev/prebuild; `npm run refresh-data`). update-sponsors/update-module-docs/update-test-docs workflows deleted. README sponsors = featured logos + maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg wall; `sponsors.mjs --readme`, PR check. Commit 7bc62f290 on PR 2647. The publish-module release-version PR still needs manual merge (ruleset requires 1 approval).\n\n**Why:** Merill wants","originalFile":"---\nname: maester-dev-site-redesign\ndescription: \"maester.dev website rewrite proposal (2026-11-02): Astro+Starlight sister site to maester.cloud, SEO plan, Ask Maester with Sign in with ChatGPT, HyperFrames explainers; awaiting Merill's review\"\nmetadata:\n  node_type: memory\n  type: project\n  originSessionId: 2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a\n  modified: 2026-11-02T12:37:57.123Z\n---\n\nProposal (private artifact): https://claude.ai/artifact/7BUFL5w1kw6PMLNLKsTVZ8. Mock canvas: https://claude.ai/artifact/PfMudyAzivfxvRSrHibqiT (home, sponsor page, docs Quickstart, test page CIS.M365.1.1.1, test catalog, Ask Maester panel, design language). Source files were in the session scratchpad only, so later edits must start from an Artifact `read`.\n\nRecommended: Astro 6 + Starlight themed with maester.cloud's tokens (maester.cloud website is Astro 6 + Tailwind 4 in ~/github/maester-cloud/website/src, already has AiAssistant.astro). Tabs: Guides · Test catalog · Commands · Packs · Changelog. Explainers authored as HyperFrames HTML compositions in website/explainers/, rendered in CI (Merill asked for these on the home page and in the docs).\n\nSEO facts measured 2026-11-02: 2,679 sitemap URLs. Every canonical (no trailing slash) is answered with a 308 to the trailing-slash URL. /docs/next (1,033 URLs) is self-canonical. 2.3 has 745 command pages vs 80 in 3.0, so ~665 need 301s to their test pages.\n\nSign in with ChatGPT: website sign-in is a limited trial for selected partners. Open-source token sharing targets apps that run locally, so hosted maester.dev must join the interest-form waitlist. Layer 1 (Copy page, Open in ChatGPT/Claude, .md pages, llms.txt, docs MCP) needs no approval.\n\nProof and sponsors (added 2026-11-02 at Merill's request): lead customer story is Entra.Chat 67 \"How Xbox Secures 70+ Entra Tenants Every Night with Maester\" (Audrey Long, Xbox Security; YouTube Je0nQ8j305w; recording in Riverside session 48821659-db95-4f70-92c7-3ddf976c8d7c). Quotes used are verbatim from that transcript and need Audrey's and Microsoft's sign-off before going live. Merill dislikes the current site screenshots: plan is a live demo report from report/ and HTML product tour, no screenshots. Merill's GitHub sponsors CyberDrain and Graham Gold aren't in sponsors.json (probably private), so never show them without consent; mock sponsor logos are Contoso/Fabrikam examples.\n\nVersions (2026-11-02): no copied docs trees and no next.maester.dev. One page per thing; stable vs preview marked inside pages via <Since>/<Changed> computed against website/version-config.js, plus stable+preview module catalogs and a website/data/versions.json history. Version never in the URL (?v= from report links only). Explainers are living: data-bound, watch-list bot reminder on PRs, renders kept by hash; recommend live HyperFrames player on site, video for YouTube.\n\nBuild (2026-11-02, Merill said go ahead): Astro 7.4.1 + Starlight 0.42.8 in worktree .claude/worktrees/website-astro, branch feat/website-astro (uncommitted at end of session). Content stays in website/docs (custom loader src/lib/content-loader.ts); tests built from committed src/data/test-catalog.json; docs default to the PREVIEW channel (Merill's ruling) and preview-only tests/commands always show how to get the preview (/docs/preview). URL contract src/data/url-contract.txt (2,679 URLs) checked on every build; _redirects generated. Explainers: live @hyperframes/player 0.8.181 (pinned, package publishes several times a day), compositions in public/explainers. Cloudflare Pages settings (output dist, Node 24) must change at merge. Xbox story hidden until media.json approved date set.\n\nRound 2 (2026-11-02): hero = real 3.0 report (public/demo/report.html built by scripts/build-demo-report.mjs from the report-redesign worktree's report/dist + sample data, sanitised to Contoso and Microsoft demo personas; views captured by scripts/capture-demo-report.mjs). How-it-works = HyperFrames composition public/explainers/how-it-works with Kokoro voice (af_heart, \"Mayster\" spelling) + synthesised music mixed by scripts/narration (not in CI). Player needs runtime-src (self-hosted @hyperframes/core 0.8.181) or audio doesn't play. Theme toggle cycles System/Light/Dark with Nucleo icons (Merill asked for System). SEO + design reviews' main findings fixed; remaining list in that turn's summary.\n\nRound 3 (2026-11-02, Merill's rulings): blog is NOT in Starlight. It is its own `blog` collection rendered by src/pages/blog/* on SiteLayout (same header as Contributors), no left nav, card index (newest featured), reading-width posts; starlight-blog uninstalled; docs header keeps a link-only Blog topic. Home explainer: no autoplay, big red play button over a blurred title-card poster. Explainer voice starts at 0.3s (narrate.mjs lead). Starlight `markdown.processedDirs` must list the content folders (docs, .generated/tests, versioned_docs, blog) or :::asides silently render as plain divs. Committed and pushed 2026-11-03 as 3a7c06795 to origin/feat/website-astro (upstream was origin/main before: always push to the feature branch explicitly). No PR yet.\n\n**Why:** Merill wants to review the overall plan and design before any execution.\n**How to apply:** Don't start building until he rules on the open decisions listed in the proposal: stack, launch with 3.0 GA, 2.x archive, OpenAI application, trailing-slash fix PR, stats/analytics, hero message, explainer format, Xbox story sign-off, sponsor tiers/prices, whether to thank current private sponsors. Related: [[maester-3-design]], [[maester-marketplace-design]].\n","structuredPatch":[{"oldStart":5,"oldLines":7,"newStart":5,"newLines":7,"lines":["   node_type: memory","   type: project","   originSessionId: 2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","-  modified: 2026-11-02T12:37:57.123Z","+  modified: 2026-11-02T20:01:50.634Z"," ---"," "," Proposal (private artifact): https://claude.ai/artifact/7BUFL5w1kw6PMLNLKsTVZ8. Mock canvas: https://claude.ai/artifact/PfMudyAzivfxvRSrHibqiT (home, sponsor page, docs Quickstart, test page CIS.M365.1.1.1, test catalog, Ask Maester panel, design language). Source files were in the session scratchpad only, so later edits must start from an Artifact `read`."]},{"oldStart":26,"oldLines":5,"newStart":26,"newLines":7,"lines":[" "," Round 3 (2026-11-02, Merill's rulings): blog is NOT in Starlight. It is its own `blog` collection rendered by src/pages/blog/* on SiteLayout (same header as Contributors), no left nav, card index (newest featured), reading-width posts; starlight-blog uninstalled; docs header keeps a link-only Blog topic. Home explainer: no autoplay, big red play button over a blurred title-card poster. Explainer voice starts at 0.3s (narrate.mjs lead). Starlight `markdown.processedDirs` must list the content folders (docs, .generated/tests, versioned_docs, blog) or :::asides silently render as plain divs. Committed and pushed 2026-11-03 as 3a7c06795 to origin/feat/website-astro (upstream was origin/main before: always push to the feature branch explicitly). No PR yet."," ","+Round 4 (2026-11-03, Merill's ruling \"Yes, do it here\"): no bot PRs for site data. build-website.yaml builds on PRs and deploys to Cloudflare Pages via wrangler on push to main + daily + dispatch (env `maester.dev`, secrets CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN/ACCOUNT_ID, var CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT default `maester`; Merill must set these and disable Cloudflare git builds). test-catalog.json, contributors.json, sponsors.json, docs/commands/*.mdx (not readme.mdx) are gitignored and written by website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs (predev/prebuild; `npm run refresh-data`). update-sponsors/update-module-docs/update-test-docs workflows deleted. README sponsors = featured logos + maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg wall; `sponsors.mjs --readme`, PR check. Commit 7bc62f290 on PR 2647. The publish-module release-version PR still needs manual merge (ruleset requires 1 approval).","+"," **Why:** Merill wants to review the overall plan and design before any execution."," **How to apply:** Don't start building until he rules on the open decisions listed in the proposal: stack, launch with 3.0 GA, 2.x archive, OpenAI application, trailing-slash fix PR, stats/analytics, hero message, explainer format, Xbox story sign-off, sponsor tiers/prices, whether to thank current private sponsors. Related: [[maester-3-design]], [[maester-marketplace-design]]."]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"210a4485-ad35-4270-b392-e55d5387717e","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","root":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","branch":"feat/website-astro","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"maester365/maester","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"blindzero","host":"github.com","remote":"blindzero/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"jeanphilippegeorge","host":"github.com","remote":"JeanPhilippeGeorge/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"mynster","host":"github.com","remote":"Mynster9361/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"maester365/maester","visibility":"public"},{"name":"pr-author","host":"github.com","remote":"soulemike/maester","visibility":"unknown"},{"name":"thetechgy","host":"github.com","remote":"thetechgy/maester","visibility":"unknown"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"maester365/maester","visibility":"public"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c81e4600-a064-41b7-970b-55d7e29f950a","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"feat/website-astro","slug":"breezy-giggling-flame"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a","hash":"0df512a6044619141776db3de0bfd7ec369a740acb22fd0ea3947f80e90fcb51","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Pushed. Updating the PR description's merge checklist and my notes:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01QneFASUKx4Wb9FB6FDpZHu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/merill/github/maester/.claude/worktrees/website-astro && P=/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-merill-github-maester/2d9f0177-c129-494c-a54f-610e3d37d77a/scratchpad/pr-body.md && python3 - \"$P\" <<'EOF'\nimport sys\np=sys.argv[1]; s=open(p).read()\na='''**Test builder** has its own header tab, inside the docs layout.\n'''\nb=a+'''\n**Build and deploy**\n- `build-website.yaml` builds the site on pull requests and, on every push to main, daily and on request, deploys it to Cloudflare Pages with `wrangler pages deploy`.\n- The generated data is no longer committed: the test catalog, command pages, contributor credits and sponsors are written by `website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs` before each `npm run dev` / `npm run build`.\n- `update-sponsors`, `update-module-docs` and `update-test-docs` are removed, so merges no longer produce bot PRs to approve.\n- The README's sponsor avatars are an image built on each deploy (`maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg`).\n'''\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\na='''- **Cloudflare Pages settings must change:** build output `website/dist`, Node 24. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed; `build-website.yaml` builds the new site.'''\nb='''- **Cloudflare deploys from Actions:** create a `maester.dev` environment with the secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` (Cloudflare Pages: Edit) and `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID`. Set the `CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT` variable if the Pages project isn't named `maester`, and turn off the project's own builds from git. The `build-docs.yaml` and `publish-versioned-docs.yml` workflows are removed.'''\nassert a in s; s=s.replace(a,b)\nopen(p,'w').write(s)\nEOF\ngh pr edit 2647 --body-file \"$P\" >/dev/null && echo edited","description":"Update the PR description for the new deploy"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01BGyQ2gmgb8KgoM8AtnEwj8","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/merill/.claude/projects/-Users-merill-github-maester/memory/maester-dev-site-redesign.md","old_string":"**Why:** Merill wants","new_string":"Round 4 (2026-11-03, Merill's ruling \"Yes, do it here\"): no bot PRs for site data. build-website.yaml builds on PRs and deploys to Cloudflare Pages via wrangler on push to main + daily + dispatch (env `maester.dev`, secrets CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN/ACCOUNT_ID, var CLOUDFLARE_PAGES_PROJECT default `maester`; Merill must set these and disable Cloudflare git builds). test-catalog.json, contributors.json, sponsors.json, docs/commands/*.mdx (not readme.mdx) are gitignored and written by website/scripts/prepare-data.mjs (predev/prebuild; `npm run refresh-data`). update-sponsors/update-module-docs/update-test-docs workflows deleted. README sponsors = featured logos + maester.dev/readme/sponsors.svg wall; `sponsors.mjs --readme`, PR check. Commit 7bc62f290 on PR 2647. The publish-module release-version PR still needs manual merge (ruleset requires 1 approval).\n\n**Why:** Merill wants"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
